  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The HALO Trust - Humanitarian mine action Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian mine action. Manual clearance, non-technical surveys. 

Goal: Risks from mines, cluster munitions and other explosive weapons are reduced to a level where civilians can live safely and development is not constrained. 
Outcome 1: Security and stability is enhances, risk of death and injury to individuals and communities reduced. 
Outcome 2: Enhanced resilience for rural communities and vulnerable groups by improving access to resources, livelihoods and socio-economic opportunities. 
HALO operates with an integrated gender-sensitive approach to ensure that women&#x2019;s voices are incorporated throughout the land release process.</narrative>
  </description>
